			y: 6.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["5795EAFBAB034E45", "731F761B242263ED"]
			description: [
				"The &6LV Greenhouse&r adds a fluid hatch to the steam design: water in means mushrooms, berries, vines and flowers the dry version could never grow."
				"Every Steam Greenhouse recipe still runs here too, just faster."
