		{
			dependencies: ["73CA53E9E02D4639"]
			description: [
				"Drop fertilizer and a programmed circuit in the greenhouse's input bus and every recipe doubles its output in half the time."
				"Make it in the mixer from dirt, sawdust and sand, or in the chemical reactor from ash and a phosphate - the arc furnace's leftover ash finally has somewhere to go."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:fertilizer"
