		{
			dependencies: ["73CA53E9E02D4639"]
			description: [
				"The &6Creature Simulator&r turns a model, some biomass and the right mineral into a mob's drops. Nobody gets hunted, nothing gets farmed by hand."
				"A programmed circuit picks the roll - circuit 1 always gives everything a kill would."
