		{
			dependencies: ["15D34CE9F5FCE6B3"]
			description: [
				"GTM wants ender pearls as early as LV, but the real synthesis needs beryllium you won't see before the Nether and a tier you won't see for a while yet."
				"So here is one, free. Print the enderman model with it and the simulator takes it from there - every pearl after this one is machine-made."
