		{
			dependencies: ["09FAB2A84C90B5D6"]
			description: [
				"The &6Electrolyzer&r breaks a dust apart into its elements with nothing but electricity - no reagent spent."
				"First real job: splitting sapphire dust into aluminium, later in this chapter."
