		{
			dependencies: ["50622961B58725B8"]
			description: [
				"The &6Chemical Reactor&r runs the small chemistry this era needs: oxygen into sulfuric acid, salt into persulfate and iron chloride."
				"The hydrogen that comes off both lines is worth keeping in a tank - do not vent it, MV wants it back."
			]
