		{
			dependencies: ["3C89167418EA462B", "6D668A4CB9B8384A"]
			description: ["Everything you soldered by hand to open this tier, the &6Circuit Assembler&r now does in a batch: board, tubes and cable in, LV circuits out, no hands involved."]
